== Thursday, September 4, 2025 ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Time !! Activity
|-
| 12:30 PM || Arrival, Registration
|-
| 1:00 PM || Welcome │ Peter Bell and Melanie Ulz
|-
| 1:15–2:00 PM || Input 1 │ Olaf Simons – Critical Perspectives on Knowledge Orders and Research Data (25 min)
Discussion
|-
| 2:00–2:45 PM || Input 2 │ Aline Deicke (Marburg) – Data Architecture and the Development of Virtual Research Environments (25 min)
Discussion
|-
| 2:45–3:15 PM || Coffee Break
|-
| 3:15–4:00 PM || Input 3 │ Erik Stein – Critical Analysis of Antiziganist and Ambivalent Content (25 min)
Discussion
|-
| 4:00–4:45 PM || Presentation of the Research Environment │ Peter Bell and Mohammad Fazleh Elahi (25 min)
Discussion
|-
| 4:45–5:15 PM || Initial Assessments, Open Questions, Ideas for Further Development │ N.N. Respondent (Peter to ask?)
|-
| 7:00 PM || Joint Dinner (optional, informal) at “Spanish Restaurant am Theater” or Italien Restaurant (Please reserve!)
|}

