== Thursday, September 4, 2025 ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Time !! Activity !! Presenter !! Material
|-
| 12:30 PM || Arrival, Registration || || 
|-
| 1:00 PM || Welcome || Peter Bell and Melanie Ulz || 
|-
| 1:15–2:00 PM || Critical Perspectives on Knowledge Orders and Research Data (25 min)<br>Discussion || Olaf Simons || 
|-
| 2:00–2:45 PM || Data Architecture and the Development of Virtual Research Environments (25 min)<br>Discussion || Aline Deicke (Marburg) || 
|-
| 2:45–3:15 PM || Coffee Break || || 
|-
| 3:15–4:00 PM || Critical Analysis of Antiziganist and Ambivalent Content (25 min)<br>Discussion || Erik Stein || 
|-
| 4:00–4:45 PM || Presentation of the Research Environment (25 min)<br>Discussion || Peter Bell and Mohammad Fazleh Elahi || 
|-
| 4:45–5:15 PM || Initial Assessments, Open Questions, Ideas for Further Development || N.N. Respondent || 
|-
| 7:00 PM || Joint Dinner (optional, informal) at “Spanish Restaurant am Theater” or Italien Restaurant || || 
|}

== Friday, September 5, 2025 ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Time !! Activity !! Presenter !! Material
